{"server":"tw","storyId":"act33side_level_act33side_08_end","groupId":"act33side","stageId":"act33side_08","title":"終局倒計時","storyCode":"BB-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act33side/level_act33side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"c49d57b438bb2475888e9c1a0bccec4a3282ed7afe8718bd5026c249dd78a388","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"勝利的前夕，意外卻終究發生。特蕾西婭意識到了博士刹那的混亂思緒。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_3"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡茲戴爾地區，荒野某處"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈——哈哈哈哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"預言？什麼預言，阿斯卡綸沒有殺掉我，沒有！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被言說的仍需辨別，被辨別的仍可更改——預言法術的本質不過是推測和計算，當然沒什麼無法違逆的命運！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獨眼巨人王庭就是一個天大的笑話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啐。真疼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有死在阿斯卡綸手裡，我沒有如自己預言的那般死在阿斯卡綸手裡……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼死的就該是她了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她勢必會來確認我的屍體，那麼，你們就會釘住她的影子，撕扯她的身體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也受了傷，我也不是白白挨打……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你們在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這個時候，把武器，對準我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰收買了你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有任何人，老大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"只是個藉機上位的好機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好機會？確實是個好機會……巴別塔進了城，你們可以用我的人頭討好他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴別塔要是輸了，你們也可以回到疤痕商場，把握住自己的處境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩卡茲雇傭兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“疤眼”沉默地看著這些被他親手安排在此的伏兵。\n風掠過，有一些自己的血腥味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“疤眼”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1294_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好算計啊，老伙計們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"命運沒有殺死他。確實。他做到了。他做到了逆轉預言。\n然後他死在了自己親手搭建的舞台上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_victoria"},{"type":"narration","text":"維多利亞，倫蒂尼姆"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"坐落在倫蒂尼姆中的龐大宮殿群總是過於安靜。\n特雷西斯對生活在其中的麻木貴族嗤之以鼻，他唯獨敬重一批又一批用生命為代價走到自己身前的同胞。\n哪怕他們舉起的刀，指向的是自己——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"曼弗雷德，對敵人留情只會害死自己。不要再犯相同的錯誤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，將軍……我以為——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"專心應敵。這些埋伏在我們身邊的叛徒恐怕已經準備了很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們撥動了維多利亞人的心弦。現在唯有我們自己能撲滅這場叛亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"*古老的薩卡茲語*——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他輕細的密令聲剛落，一道道身影已經無聲無息地介入了混亂的現場。\n像一陣掠過的風，吹散了傾盆而下的暴雨。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"棄名死士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1307_1","isRemote":false,"text":"退後。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴別塔刺客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖。這些人我們來處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巴別塔刺客","speakerId":"avg_npc_1306_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尤莉葉，你和其他人繼續。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了解。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——別想碰將軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，會輪到你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我是將軍的衛官，刺客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"尤莉葉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那你最好把劍握緊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一道不顯眼的弧線從尤莉葉的眼前掃過。\n涼意逼人。她渾身僵硬。\n她想起了在疤痕商場見到殿下的那天。\n那時，自己手中的刀甚至都不敢舉起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"足夠了，曼弗雷德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"曼弗雷德","speakerId":"avg_npc_404_1","isRemote":false,"text":"將軍！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們來到我的面前是為了追尋榮耀的死亡，而非憐憫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們正用生命向我證明他們所見之未來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們正在進行一場賽跑，身處卡茲戴爾的她同樣面臨數不盡的威脅——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你們的終點，是我的，或是她的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就給你們這個機會吧。來，殺死我，劊子手，不要讓特蕾西婭失望。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"倒數計時\n2時7分21秒"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“破碎”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"慌亂的王庭軍","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"門，門破了！他們要進來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"倒數計時\n1時33分48秒"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知所有內應行動，繳械巡邏部隊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":true,"text":"城內防衛很薄弱，幾乎只有軍事委員會的城防部隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"avg_npc_1309_1","isRemote":true,"text":"在他們合流之前逐個擊破。動作快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哪怕雙方都盡量避免戰火波及到城內，這也不太正常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把所有情報傳回給博士，行動小隊加快速度，隨時警惕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拔除軍事委員會在廣場上的旗幟，打開全城廣播頻段。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"倒數計時\n49分59秒"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"準備聯繫本艦接駁，盡快讓殿下他們進入我們的控制區域。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有通知阿斯卡綸的隊伍，盡快會合。已經有三支小隊提前完成了戰略部署。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來去哪，凱爾希醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……巴別塔舊址。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巴別塔的旗幟已經很多年沒有在那裡升起來過了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希走在街道上，前往巴別塔辦事處的路線她依舊輕車熟路。\n街道上的薩卡茲們都在悄悄地行動起來，他們盡可能地爬上了建築上的最高處，不約而同地將目光投向了城中的那處廢墟。\n一面曾經消失在卡茲戴爾城內許多年的旗子緩緩升了起來——\n巴別塔，回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Mantra最近一次彙報，我們已經完全打通了五條要道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要順利，此時此刻，凱爾希應該已經看見了熔爐的焰火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，卡茲戴爾的城防措施幾乎都被癱瘓，我們可以登上那座城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"但軍事委員會不可能放棄卡茲戴爾，我們若想完全控制城市，還需要一些時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"到那時，我們可能無法完全避免對卡茲戴爾主城區的破壞——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我感受到了，他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們仍在這裡，卻不打算出手幫助任何一方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，我們的戰鬥多了幾位傲慢的旁觀者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"……特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有……不同尋常的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾乎灼痛靈魂的殺心，淒苦，和決意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"軍事委員會的刺客。他們從一開始就打算以城市為餌，重創巴別塔本部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"這也在預料之內。但這一次，我們沒什麼可博弈和算計的了，真刀真槍地擊潰這些刺客，回到我們的城市吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我會去控制艦船內的防禦系統，並負責指揮防禦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必把又一次廝殺，帶進那座餘暉中的城市。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"倒數計時\n22分48秒"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可露希爾，本艦聯繫上了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":true,"text":"暫時沒有回應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可露希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_050","isRemote":true,"text":"還，還在覆寫城內廣播的功率設置，嘗試擴大範圍。也許是本艦通訊暫時故障……我還在努力恢復通訊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"倒數計時\n12分57秒"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生，我感覺到一些異樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的母親……曾為每一個她所親愛的生命設下咒文……當生命逝去，輓歌便會連接起我們的心神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但此刻，我並無恙，卻……"},{"type":"narration","text":"凱爾希突然渾身冰涼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"……巴別塔即使佔領了卡茲戴爾，也勢必損失慘重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"特雷西斯說得對，他們無法統一，薩卡茲的分裂會常態化。相當長的時間內，薩卡茲依然不可能從弱勢群體變成世界的領導者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"重要的是，我向特雷西斯指出了另一道路。他在倫蒂尼姆的計劃便有更大的機會成功，薩卡茲將用源石腐化大地，摧毀他們的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是很好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"有這樣一個堅韌的種族成為我們的信徒，成為源石蔓延在幕布上的第一處閃亮的血漬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧……我們……不需要毀滅他們，更不需要殺死她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"我……應該利用“文明的存續”，嘗試更好地引導它潛在的性能，我沒必要……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"內部序列開始檢索，檢索到管理員權限。\n已驗證。權限正常。\n歡迎您，Dr.{@nickname}。\n已進入<color=#FF4200>（全艦防禦系統）</color>。請確認下一步操作……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……博士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士！你聽得見嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……奇怪，博士的情感……有些異樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"強烈，激昂，帶有……陰影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士到底……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"那是傳送門破碎的光火，像是一條陰燃的裂痕劃過天空。\n直到數個世紀後才會消散於無形。\n群星從我們所站立的地方遠去了，如夜晚的樹葉。\n但塔衛二的航船還是來到了這片遍地瓦礫的廢墟。\n那是生命。\n那是我們在末日後一度失去的東西，那是可以驅散一切氤氳黑暗的古老頌歌。\n<color=#888888>？？？</color>\n我們至今仍未明白生命是如何出現在茫茫星海之中的。\n但我想，我們都應該歌頌萬物生靈，歌頌我們自己。\n源石是我們譜下的歌譜，是獻給後來者的曲調。插手文明的演化是傲慢的，但我別無他法。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g11_rhodesdeck_bc"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我違背了諾言。我背叛了在時間中等待的她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是因為我愛著。愛著生命。愛著存在。愛是永恆的純真。使我不去思考。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希，學會去愛，學會去相信。你將不得不去思考，去引導，去直面山坡上總是尖叫著墜落的滾石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但……到最後……我相信，你會學會愛。那是永恆的純真，是呼吸的兒女，是你我的本性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。凱爾希。先去周圍看看，再去遠一些的山那頭看看。去尋找存在的形式……我得回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她曾教會我所有，曾熱烈地探索這一切，但她已經變了，她不會給擅自行動的我留太多時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"預言家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……下一次，再見吧。我們會再見的。凱爾希。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我相信它們。相信你，凱爾希。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希……我時間不多了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"去尋找生命的痕跡，去尋找希望與未來。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凱爾希……自己去得出答案吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"去找到你自己。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"是否確認關閉全艦防禦系統？\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……\n……"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g10_theresaoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"已選擇<color=#FF4200>（重啟登艦身分驗證）</color>。已確認。\n已選擇<color=#FF4200>（重啟全艦通訊模組）</color>。已確認。\nLoading……\n倒數計時已歸零。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_abyss_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"博士","speakerId":"avg_npc_048","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"操作面板的螢光反射在博士的面罩上。\n隨著螢幕關閉，面罩之下的人最終隱入黑暗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>如何評價為了維護族群的利益而不惜一切的人？</i>\n<i>有人稱之為英雄。有人稱之為傳奇。</i>\n<i>可這樣的名號往往只能紮根於戰亂四起的年代。</i>\n<i>當短暫的和平年代到來之時，一夜之間，切實可觸碰的傳說們似乎都成為了故事中的泡影。</i>\n<i>聽故事的孩子們會問，背負這些璀璨名號的人又為何全都銷聲匿跡了呢？</i>\n<i>……</i>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因為他們主動選擇留在了過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"使命既已終結，他們所締造的新時代也無需留下他們的一席之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"傳奇已被遺忘。英雄無人銘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而死亡終將如約而至，無人可逃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"責任將驅使英雄，用自己的死寫下答案，踩出泥濘的路面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這就是我們的宿命。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g12_sandstorm"},{"type":"narration","text":"1086年\n巴別塔離開卡茲戴爾的前夕"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許多年之後，許多自我們搭建起家園後便銷聲匿跡的遺落者會加入我們的事業……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們會背負上駡名，幫助我們結束這場爭論。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_1296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雙子並肩站在一起。\n憑藉黑色王冠儲存的記憶，他們行走於當年的戰場。一如往昔。\n兩位混血的薩卡茲走下了魔王崩塌的車輦，走向了戰場——\n走向了未來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那這就是我們的告別？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，在當年我們決定攜手改變卡茲戴爾的地方，告別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕成為他們的魔王這麼多年，有時，你……還跟以前一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在我們尚且年幼時，我常常因織衣而刺破手指，污染了賣給客人的長袍，你還記得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"記得……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那時你還是一個不被允許佩戴真劍的苦悶學徒，總想著有朝一日能成為卡茲戴爾的兵卒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那時的我，尚不理解我們為何要承受四處躲藏的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"終於有一天，王庭欣賞我的手藝，我得以面見以勒什。那時，我鼓起勇氣向魔王發問——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們的未來在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他沒有回答，只是將我趕了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"直到後來我們疲憊地帶兵回到故鄉廢墟的那天我才明白，我追尋的答案不在其他地方，就在“這裡”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——在“卡茲戴爾”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾只會因為我們中一人的離去而再度輝煌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但失敗的注定是你，你一定要堅持嗎？特蕾西婭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的身邊也有許多人支持我呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可更多數飽受壓迫和欺淩的薩卡茲選擇了反抗和暴力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"無論剩下的人是否願意，他們遲早被這股浪潮裹挾，捲入其中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可我們這一代人總得做點什麼。我不想，讓這股仇恨從我的手中再傳遞給下一代繼續輪迴……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特蕾西婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕未來不由我改變，但點燃火種的希望需要由我們來傳遞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我也需要對那些追隨我的人負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"響應戰爭的聲浪並非只來源於卡茲戴爾，這片大地已經沒有我們的容身之所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我能做的，只有推他們一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我也會留在這裡，留在新一代薩卡茲於未來回望的過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如你一般。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
